  "description": "RAGJUI crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C92 H85 Er5 N18 O20 2+,2(C15 H14 N3 O3 1-),2(C1 H4 O1),5(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Er1 (Er) has 7 O neighbors; Er2 (Er) has 7 O neighbors; Er3 (Er) has 8 O neighbors; Er4 (Er) has 6 O neighbors; Er5 (Er) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.487-3.567 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 91.51-100.47°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Er5(HL)6(CH3O)(CH3OH)]·2(H2L)·2(CH3OH)·5H2O.",
